{"v":1,"id":"98e6102e-32cf-8e93-b5c9-b118f977d406","kind":"glowfic/thread","at":"2022-01-05T03:53:52Z","author":{"actor":"unknown","operator":"deepfates","imported_by":"splice/glowfic-json@0.1","source":"fixture:glowfic-thread:5506","via":"glowfic-dl@fixture"},"parents":[],"payload":{"id":"5506","title":"take this report back and bring her a better report","url":"https://glowfic.com/posts/5506","description":null,"authors":["Iarwain","lintamande"]}}
{"v":1,"id":"8693b138-a00e-8b95-9de7-50f58120a93f","kind":"glowfic/post","at":"2022-01-05T03:53:52Z","author":{"actor":"Iarwain","operator":"deepfates","imported_by":"splice/glowfic-json@0.1","source":"fixture:glowfic-thread:post-5506","via":"glowfic-dl@fixture"},"parents":["98e6102e-32cf-8e93-b5c9-b118f977d406"],"payload":{"post_id":"post-5506","author":"Iarwain","character_display_name":null,"character_handle":null,"icon_url":null,"timestamp":"2022-01-05T03:53:52Z","content":"<div class=\"post-content\"><p>When Carissa Sevar opens her eyes again, it's in a bedroom that looks not very Imperial.&nbsp; Everything here that isn't alive is soft and white, from the deep deep mattress she's lying upon, to the coverlet over her, to the pillow beneath her head.&nbsp; There's vines with varieties of exotic flowers growing on the walls, the ceiling, to prevent all that whiteness from being too unrelieved a picture.</p>\n<p>Nothing is hurting her, at all, and also she's not a statue, in case that wasn't clear.&nbsp; No runes on her skin.</p></div>"}}
{"v":1,"id":"7fb37fd4-71cc-880f-8e38-e6a14c6ba2fc","kind":"glowfic/post","at":"2022-01-05T03:55:00.000Z","author":{"actor":"Carissa Sevar","operator":"deepfates","imported_by":"splice/glowfic-json@0.1","source":"fixture:glowfic-thread:reply-1739831","via":"glowfic-dl@fixture"},"parents":["8693b138-a00e-8b95-9de7-50f58120a93f"],"payload":{"post_id":"reply-1739831","author":"lintamande","character_display_name":"Carissa Sevar","character_handle":"to-let-you-in","icon_url":"https://d1anwqy6ci9o1i.cloudfront.net/users%2F34%2Ficons%2Fkfut47cwkqm4oumgvby1s_Screen+Shot+2020-12-06+at+9.27.36+PM.png","timestamp":"Jan 04, 2022  7:55 PM","content":"<div class=\"post-content\"><p>What?</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>That doesn't make any sense. She's no longer doing any very complicated sensemaking, hasn't been for a while, but that -</p>\n<p>- but she exists -</p>\n<p>- what if it's a mistake and soon someone will catch it no that doesn't make any sense -</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>- did someone find her? Eventually, somewhere, someday -</p></div>"}}
